# GitHub Linguist Overrides to clean up repository language statistics
# Treat all documentation as docs (removes it from language bar)
docs/* linguist-documentation
*.md linguist-documentation
README.md linguist-documentation
brag_document.md linguist-documentation

# Treat generated/config files as generated (removes them from language bar)
*.json linguist-generated
*.yaml linguist-generated
*.yml linguist-generated
package-lock.json linguist-generated
yarn.lock linguist-generated
pnpm-lock.yaml linguist-generated

# Ignore testing/mock data
tests/fixtures/* linguist-vendored
mocks/* linguist-vendored
